    'M7 2C4.24 2 2 4.24 2 7v10c0 2.76 2.24 5 5 5h10c2.76 0 5-2.24 5-5V7c0-2.76-2.24-5-5-5zm0 2h10c1.66 0 3 1.34 3 3v10c0 1.66-1.34 3-3 3H7c-1.66 0-3-1.34-3-3V7c0-1.66 1.34-3 3-3zm10.5 1a1.5 1.5 0 1 0 0 3 1.5 1.5 0 0 0 0-3zM12 7a5 5 0 1 0 0 10 5 5 0 0 0 0-10zm0 2a3 3 0 1 1 0 6 3 3 0 0 1 0-6z',
